      "en": "Then the LORD’s word came to him, saying,",
      "ko": "여호와의 말씀이 엘리야에게 임하여 가라사대",
      "source_text_hash": "2563e4b0191232a320ea699b0da4762a10b11c4009d0f1fa8864270d60d14a37",
      "translation_text_hash": "cc5c51e847af9792d521c16ff5c660a5c93ecfbdf900b631aaef9aab7b797770",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
