      "en": "So he went and did according to the LORD’s word, for he went and lived by the brook Cherith that is before the Jordan.",
      "ko": "저가 여호와의 말씀과 같이 하여 곧 가서 요단 앞 그릿 시냇가에 머물매",
      "source_text_hash": "5b1c94dab58da4c9704fbb78afe4661f41d6283725b4eed50c7748caf4844cc3",
      "translation_text_hash": "0e1fd4004f569096170664e199f5dda7144c1bf76398b401901facf5e53ac452",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "저가 여호와의 말씀과 같이 하여 곧 가서 요단 앞 그릿 시냇가에 머물매"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "0e1fd4004f569096170664e199f5dda7144c1bf76398b401901facf5e53ac452"
      ]
    },
    {
